# InspectAgent build context rules (allow-list).
#
# Docker only reads .dockerignore from the root of the build context, so:
#   * CodeBuild (deploy/aws/buildspec.yml) copies this file to ./.dockerignore before `docker build`;
#   * deploy/aws/deploy.py applies exactly these rules (Docker semantics) when it zips the source;
#   * for a local build run:  cp deploy/.dockerignore .dockerignore
#     then  docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile.lambda .   (or -f deploy/Dockerfile for the generic image).
#
# Exclude everything, then re-include only what the images need. Later rules win.
*
!inspectagent
!samples
!models
!results
!scripts/__init__.py
!scripts/bench_cv.py
!requirements*.txt
!deploy

# Never ship caches, local runs, build outputs, archives or secrets.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
results/cache
deploy/aws/.build
